  "_comment": "Source of truth for the policy library. Edit this (via Claude Code) to add/update policies, then run `python policy-formatter/tools/publish.py` to (re)generate the PDFs into docs/files and refresh docs/library.json. Each policy keeps an `editions` list (oldest first; the last one is the current version). To publish a new version, append a new edition with its own `source` .docx, `date`, `version`, `approval_date` and `notes` (a short changelog) — the older editions and their PDFs are kept so the web library can show full version history.",
